sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin
  participant Staff as Staff member
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  Admin->>Web: Employees, Add Employee, role, joining date, salary
  Web->>API: POST /employees
  API->>PG: refuse if the phone exists anywhere on the Platform
  API->>PG: insert employee, EMP code, assignment with role, first compensation plan version
  PG-->>API: access_version raised after commit
  API-->>Web: Employee created
  Admin->>Web: User Admin, Create User, Staff existing employee
  Web->>API: POST /user with type employee
  API->>PG: login limit check, user created, linked to every active assignment, portal access on
  Admin->>Web: Schedule tab, Save
  Web->>API: POST /employees/:employeeId/schedule
  API->>PG: seven employee_schedules rows for this location
  Admin->>Web: Compensation tab, Save version
  Web->>API: POST /assignments/:assignmentId/compensation-plans
  API->>PG: close the old version, insert the new one
  Staff->>Web: Sign in with email and password
  Web->>API: POST /auth/login, then POST /auth/select-location when asked
  API-->>Web: access token and refresh cookie
  Web->>API: GET /me/access
  API-->>Web: permissions, features, home page
